#. ID 46, Page 2, Line 4, Pos (16,26)
#. ID 87, Page 2, Line 4, Pos (80,26)
msgid ""
"この身体では\n"
"レバーを動かすことは不可能だ……。"
msgstr "以这具身体无法扳动拉杆……。"

#. ID 46, Page 2, Line 9, Pos (16,26)
#. Contains choice at line 2 (2 options)
#. ID 87, Page 2, Line 8, Pos (80,26)
